    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0575","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Yusuf Pereira talks about the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding. Background noise: a gallery fan, rain, and someone hammering a nail into a work in progress.</Description>
