        </Contact>
        <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"project","fieldKey":"projectDescription"} -->
        <Description LanguageId="ISO639-3:eng">A documentation project recording abstract artists talking about work that, they insist, is not about anything. Interviews took place in studios, galleries, one disused swimming pool and a lift that was stuck between floors. The artists speak Kürbinian, Edolo, Tok Pisin and several languages they describe as "still being invented".&#xD;
Generated by sample-data-generator/torture; OtherDocuments/torture-cases.md says what each folder is for.</Description>
        <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"project","fieldKey":"projectDescription"} -->
